data.documentation:
A query
The syntax is as follows (described in terms of [CSS grammar](https://www.w3.org/TR/CSS21/grammar.html)):
query : feature* ; feature : '(' S* IDENT S* [ ':' S* value ]? ')' S* ; value : string | integer | IDENT ;
